  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">안녕하세요,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">ai 로 만든 html을 학생들에게 공유하고 편하게 관리할 수 있는 방법을 소개합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sites.google.com/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Google Drive: 로그인\" data-og-description=\"이메일 또는 휴대전화\" data-og-host=\"accounts.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sites.google.com/\" data-og-url=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fsites.google.com%2F&amp;dsh=S-503175549%3A1773809759086104&amp;followup=https%3A%2F%2Fsites.google.com%2F&amp;ifkv=ASfE1-qimNH06drlpTckc4WbMn9dyM2GOmRkMTwPSpRAA51oAC3_T8elpJInOjvOPuhwmSXfQQKv&amp;osid=1&amp;passive=1209600&amp;service=wise&amp;flowName=WebLiteSignIn&amp;flowEntry=ServiceLogin\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sites.google.com/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Google Drive: 로그인</p><p class=\"og-desc\">이메일 또는 휴대전화</p><p class=\"og-host\">accounts.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2262be6171c656618825206f36973003e39f825\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2262be6171c656618825206f36973003e39f825\" data-origin-width=\"591\" data-origin-height=\"712\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">빈 사이트를 클릭하시고 사이트를 하나 만듭니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만들어진 사이트를 클릭합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ea2969948a2864080d1e9afd5671f697ec2b828\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ea2969948a2864080d1e9afd5671f697ec2b828\" data-origin-width=\"356\" data-origin-height=\"427\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">왼쪽의 삽입- 삽입을 클릭합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e03447d8a5dd4efee59e80d4edcfe77f9c4aaf54\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e03447d8a5dd4efee59e80d4edcfe77f9c4aaf54\" data-origin-width=\"662\" data-origin-height=\"472\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>공유받은 / 제작한 html 코드 전체를 붙여 넣고 다음을 클릭합니다.</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fece39caa2207f485d50ced6dbdf1a0488cd6d62\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"634\" height=\"346\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fece39caa2207f485d50ced6dbdf1a0488cd6d62\" data-origin-width=\"1331\" data-origin-height=\"726\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">파란색 테두리를 이용해 크기를 조절합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45e85a456934e8b1676eed4cc6244f4e10d37884\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45e85a456934e8b1676eed4cc6244f4e10d37884\" data-origin-width=\"457\" data-origin-height=\"148\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">게시를 눌러 사이트를 공유합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4d1935a7411f0a83157eeb619e6ad900802c91c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4d1935a7411f0a83157eeb619e6ad900802c91c\" data-origin-width=\"826\" data-origin-height=\"663\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">기억하기 쉬운 도메인을 입력하고 게시를 누릅니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">저는 개인 수업용으로 사용하므로</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">공개 검색엔진에 내 사이트가 표시되지 않도록 요청에 체크를 한 뒤 게시했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">새로운 html를 만드셨다면</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">새로운 페이지를 추가하시고 삽입-삽입-소스 코드로 html을 임베드 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e03447d8a5dd4efee59e80d4edcfe77f9c4aaf54\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e03447d8a5dd4efee59e80d4edcfe77f9c4aaf54\" data-origin-width=\"662\" data-origin-height=\"472\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 과정만 반복하시면 쉽게 html을 공유 및 관리 할 수 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">제가 공유드린 html을 개인 사이트에 업로드한 뒤 수업에 사용해보십시오.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 외에도 사진, 파일 등 다양하게 추가 및 편집이 가능하니</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">DIY 해보시면 좋을 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">감사합니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
